#: sysd-manager-comcontroler/src/enums.rs:187
msgctxt "list"
msgid "The name is an alias (symlink to another unit file)."
msgstr "该名称是别名（指向另一个单元文件的符号链接）。"

#: sysd-manager-comcontroler/src/enums.rs:192
msgctxt "list"
msgid "The unit file is invalid or another error occurred."
msgstr "单元文件无效或发生了其他错误。"

#: sysd-manager-comcontroler/src/enums.rs:197
msgctxt "list"
msgid ""
"The unit file is not enabled, but contains an [Install] section with "
"installation instructions."
msgstr "单元文件尚未启用，但包含带有安装指令的 [Install] 段。"

#: sysd-manager-comcontroler/src/enums.rs:202
#: sysd-manager-comcontroler/src/enums.rs:239
msgctxt "list"
msgid ""
"Enabled via <span fgcolor='#62a0ea'>.wants/</span>, <span "
"fgcolor='#62a0ea'>.requires/</span> or <u>Alias=</u> symlinks (permanently "
"in <span fgcolor='#62a0ea'>/etc/systemd/system/</span>, or transiently in "
"<span fgcolor='#62a0ea'>/run/systemd/system/</span>)."
msgstr ""
"通过 <span fgcolor='#62a0ea'>.wants/</span>、<span "
"fgcolor='#62a0ea'>.requires/</span> 或 <u>Alias=</u> 符号链接启用（永久链接位"
"于 <span fgcolor='#62a0ea'>/etc/systemd/system/</span>，临时链接位于 <span "
"fgcolor='#62a0ea'>/run/systemd/system/</span>）。"

#: sysd-manager-comcontroler/src/enums.rs:207
msgctxt "list"
msgid ""
"The unit file was generated dynamically via a generator tool. See <b>man "
"systemd.generator(7)</b>. Generated unit files may not be enabled, they are "
"enabled implicitly by their generator."
msgstr ""
"单元文件由生成器动态生成。请参阅 <b>man systemd.generator(7)</b>。生成的单元"
"文件无法手动启用，而是由生成器隐式启用。"

#: sysd-manager-comcontroler/src/enums.rs:212
msgctxt "list"
msgid ""
"The unit file itself is not enabled, but it has a non-empty <u>Also=</u> "
"setting in the [Install] unit file section, listing other unit files that "
"might be enabled, or it has an alias under a different name through a "
"symlink that is not specified in <u>Also=</u>. For template unit files, an "
"instance different than the one specified in <u>DefaultInstance=</u> is "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"单元文件本身未启用，但其 [Install] 段包含非空的 <u>Also=</u> 设置，列出了其他"
"可启用的单元文件；或者它具有一个未在 <u>Also=</u> 中指定的符号链接别名。对于"
"模板单元文件，已启用的实例不同于 <u>DefaultInstance=</u> 指定的实例。"

#: sysd-manager-comcontroler/src/enums.rs:217
#: sysd-manager-comcontroler/src/enums.rs:244
msgctxt "list"
msgid ""
"Made available through one or more symlinks to the unit file (permanently in "
"<span fgcolor='#62a0ea'>/etc/systemd/system/</span> or transiently in <span "
"fgcolor='#62a0ea'>/run/systemd/system/</span>), even though the unit file "
"might reside outside of the unit file search path."
msgstr ""
"通过一个或多个符号链接使单元文件可用（永久链接位于 <span fgcolor='#62a0ea'>/"
"etc/systemd/system/</span>，临时链接位于 <span fgcolor='#62a0ea'>/run/"
"systemd/system/</span>），即使文件本身位于单元文件搜索路径之外。"

#: sysd-manager-comcontroler/src/enums.rs:222
#: sysd-manager-comcontroler/src/enums.rs:249
msgctxt "list"
msgid ""
"Completely disabled, so that any start operation on it fails (permanently in "
"<span fgcolor='#62a0ea'>/etc/systemd/system/</span> or transiently in <span "
"fgcolor='#62a0ea'>/run/systemd/systemd/</span>)."
msgstr ""
"已完全屏蔽，任何启动操作都会失败（永久屏蔽位于 <span fgcolor='#62a0ea'>/etc/"
"systemd/system/</span>，临时屏蔽位于 <span fgcolor='#62a0ea'>/run/systemd/"
"systemd/</span>）。"

#: sysd-manager-comcontroler/src/enums.rs:227
msgctxt "list"
msgid ""
"The unit file is not enabled, and has no provisions for enabling in the "
"[Install] unit file section."
msgstr "单元文件未启用，其 [Install] 段也未提供启用所需的配置。"

#: sysd-manager-comcontroler/src/enums.rs:232
msgctxt "list"
msgid ""
"The unit file has been created dynamically with the runtime API. Transient "
"units may not be enabled."
msgstr "单元文件由运行时 API 动态创建。瞬态单元无法启用。"

#: sysd-manager-comcontroler/src/enums.rs:454
msgctxt "active state"
msgid "Started, bound, plugged in, ..., depending on the unit type."
msgstr "已启动、已绑定、已接入等，具体含义取决于单元类型。"

#: sysd-manager-comcontroler/src/enums.rs:461
msgctxt "active state"
msgid "Unit is <b>active</b> and it is reloading its configuration."
msgstr "单元处于<b>活动状态</b>，正在重新加载配置。"

#: sysd-manager-comcontroler/src/enums.rs:469
msgctxt "active state"
msgid "Stopped, unbound, unplugged, ..., depending on the unit type."
msgstr "已停止、已解绑、已断开等，具体含义取决于单元类型。"

#: sysd-manager-comcontroler/src/enums.rs:476
msgctxt "active state"
msgid ""
"Similar to inactive, but the unit failed in some way (process returned error "
"code on exit, crashed, an operation timed out, or after too many restarts)."
msgstr ""
"类似于非活动状态，但单元发生了故障（进程退出时返回错误码、崩溃、操作超时或重"
"启次数过多）。"

#: sysd-manager-comcontroler/src/enums.rs:483
msgctxt "active state"
msgid "Changing from <b>inactive</b> to <b>active</b>."
msgstr "正在从<b>非活动状态</b>切换为<b>活动状态</b>。"

#: sysd-manager-comcontroler/src/enums.rs:490
msgctxt "active state"
msgid "Changing from <b>active</b> to <b>inactive</b>."
msgstr "正在从<b>活动状态</b>切换为<b>非活动状态</b>。"

#: sysd-manager-comcontroler/src/enums.rs:497
msgctxt "active state"
msgid "Unit is inactive and a maintenance operation is in progress."
msgstr "单元处于非活动状态，正在执行维护操作。"

#: sysd-manager-comcontroler/src/enums.rs:504
msgctxt "active state"
msgid "Unit is active and a new mount is being activated in its namespace."
msgstr "单元处于活动状态，正在其命名空间中激活新的挂载。"

